<title>USA: Polaroid Corp Q4 profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Polaroid Corp Q4 profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>CAMBRIDGE, Mass. 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr profit		 $0.25     loss	 $2.44</p>
<p> Net profit		11,400     loss     111,000</p>
<p> Revs		     663,400		  674,800</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  45,934		   45,456</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE - 1996 Q4 includes extraordinary loss of $1.6 million or $0.03 per share and charges of $33 million vs restructuring charges of $170 million.  </p>
<p>1996 Q4 oper shr profit $0.81 vs loss $0.01 excluding charges, extraordinary items.</p>
